---
title: Coconut Cookies
author: Grandma Gustad
category: Cookies
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sugar{1.5%cups}
@eggs{2}
@flour{2%cups}
@cream of tarter{1%tsp}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@shortening{1%cup}
@sour cream{4%Tbsp}
@baking soda{1%tsp}
@coconut{1%cup}

Drop by teaspoonfuls, press down and bake at 375 degrees until golden brown.
